# account, so an approval here blocks the merge rather than enabling it.
# `develop` requires zero approving reviews.
#
# Code-owner review is deliberately NOT required in branch protection
# (`require_code_owner_reviews: false`, read 2026-09-20). Requiring it would
# create a gate that only an approval can open and that CI refuses to let these
# accounts open.
